{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23686","headline":"题洛中第宅 · 白居易","name":"题洛中第宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水木谁家宅，门高占地宽。\n悬鱼挂青甃，行马护朱栏。\n春榭笼烟煖，秋庭锁月寒。\n松胶黏琥珀，筠粉扑琅玕。\n试问池台主，多爲将相官。\n终身不曾到，唯展宅图看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}